# Money tab model inputs. Hand-maintained. Values here are only the starting point:
# once the site is seeded, values edited under Money > Model inputs are kept on re-seed.
# status: assumed | reported (one player) | measured (clan tested) | game (robrun.info game data) | unknown | setup (your choice)
# Anything assumed, reported or unknown marks its business provisional on the Money tab.
key|business|label|value|unit|status|how_to_measure|sort
chem_concentrate_per_cycle|chem|How many Concentrate does the reactor make from one load?|1|Concentrate|assumed|Load the reactor, let it finish, and count the Concentrate that comes out.|10
chem_canisters_per_load|chem|How many Reagent Canisters does the reactor take before it starts?|1|canisters|assumed|Load canisters one at a time and count how many go in before it starts cooking.|11
chem_freezer_minutes|chem|How many minutes does the freezer take to turn 1 Concentrate into Hard Crystals?|30|minutes|assumed|Put 1 Concentrate in the freezer and time it until Hard Crystals appear. Use a freezer with no Evaporator or Refrigerant.|12
chem_split_uncommon|chem|Out of 100 Hard Crystals, how many are green (Uncommon)?|65|out of 100|assumed|Freeze 20 or more crystals, count each colour, and scale to 100.|13
chem_split_epic|chem|Out of 100 Hard Crystals, how many are purple (Epic)?|25|out of 100|assumed|Same count as above: the purple ones, scaled to 100.|14
chem_split_legendary|chem|Out of 100 Hard Crystals, how many are yellow (Legendary)?|10|out of 100|assumed|Same count as above: the yellow ones, scaled to 100.|15
chem_freezer_places|chem|How many Concentrate fit in a tier I freezer at once?|4|places|assumed|Open an empty tier I Industrial Freezer and count the places.|16
chem_powder_per_crystal|chem|How many Crystalline Powder do you get from 1 Hard Crystal?||powder|unknown|Put 1 Hard Crystal on the Lab Table and count the powder that comes out.|17
grow_hours_per_harvest|grow|How many hours from one harvest to the next?|1.5|hours|reported|Harvest a bush, note the time, and check when it is ready again. Use a table with no Fan, Water Pump or UV Lamp.|20
grow_bags_per_bush|grow|On average, how many Harvest Bags does one bush give?|3|bags|reported|Write down the bags from 20 or more harvests and take the average. robrun.info says 2 to 4.|21
grow_bushes_per_table|grow|How many bushes fit on one Grow Table?|6|bushes|game|From the game data on robrun.info. Only change it if the game shows something different.|22
grow_tables|grow|How many Grow Tables do you plan to run?|1|tables|setup|Your choice. A Grow Room fits up to 6. Each extra table adds its cost to the setup.|23
repack_minutes|repack|How many minutes does one contraband repack take?|30|minutes|reported|Time one repack at a Contraband Workbench with no Label Printer.|30
repack_rarity_rate|repack|Out of 100 repacks, how many come out as Rarity Cargo?|0|out of 100|assumed|Count Premium vs Rarity Cargo over 20 or more repacks, and scale the Rarity count to 100.|31
repack_slots|repack|How many repacks do you run at the same time?|1|at once|setup|Your choice. A Contraband Workbench starts with 1 slot; Tool Boxes add more.|32
